#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Qiskit Serverless to run quantum-classical workloads across the cloud "
"and on quantum-centric supercomputers."
msgstr ""
"Utilise Qiskit Serverless pour exécuter des charges de travail quantiques-"
"classiques dans le cloud et sur des supercalculateurs à vocation quantique."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Introduction à Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Introduction à Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless provides a simple interface to run workloads across "
"quantum-classical resources. This includes deploying programs to the IBM "
"Quantum&reg; Platform and running workloads remotely, as well as easy "
"resource management for multi-cloud and quantum-centric supercomputing use "
"cases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless fournit une interface simple pour exécuter des charges de "
"travail sur des ressources quantiques-classiques. Cela inclut le déploiement"
" de programmes sur la plateforme IBM Quantum&reg; et l'exécution de charges "
"de travail à distance, ainsi qu'une gestion simplifiée des ressources pour "
"les cas d'utilisation multi-cloud et de supercalcul à vocation quantique.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Premium users can build, deploy, and run their workloads remotely on "
"classical compute made available through IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les utilisateurs Premium peuvent créer, déployer et exécuter leurs charges "
"de travail à distance sur des ressources de calcul classiques mises à "
"disposition via IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless bénéficie d'une mise à niveau et ses fonctionnalités évoluent rapidement.** Pendant cette phase de développement, les notes de version et la documentation la plus récente sont disponibles sur la page [GitHub de Qiskit Serverless](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an experimental feature available only for IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Il s'agit d'une fonctionnalité expérimentale disponible uniquement pour les utilisateurs des plans IBM Quantum Premium, Flex et On-Prem (via l'API IBM Quantum Platform).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When should I use Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"Quand utiliser Qiskit Serverless ? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless helps manage classical and quantum resources across the "
"entire [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow. This includes "
"some of the following examples:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless facilite la gestion des ressources classiques et "
"quantiques tout au long du flux de travail [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-"
"to-patterns). Voici quelques exemples d'utilisation :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parallelizing classical tasks, such as pre-processing and post-processing\n"
msgstr ""
"Paralléliser des tâches classiques, comme le pré-traitement et le post-"
"traitement\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Persisting long-running workloads in the cloud, even if your laptop is "
"turned off\n"
msgstr ""
"Maintenir des charges de travail de longue durée dans le cloud, même si ton "
"ordinateur portable est éteint\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying reusable programs\n"
msgstr "Déployer des programmes réutilisables\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Que comprend l'environnement ? {#what-is-included}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following compute resources are included by default in the Qiskit "
"Serverless environment. Users can contact [support](/guides/support) to "
"increase any of these.\n"
msgstr ""
"Les ressources de calcul suivantes sont incluses par défaut dans "
"l'environnement Qiskit Serverless. Les utilisateurs peuvent contacter le "
"[support](/guides/support) pour en augmenter les limites.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "16 vCPU cores\n"
msgstr "16 cœurs vCPU\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "64GB RAM\n"
msgstr "64 Go de RAM\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum of two active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr "Maximum de deux jobs actifs par utilisateur à tout moment\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Installer Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To use Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum Platform, install the following "
"packages:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pour utiliser Qiskit Serverless sur IBM Quantum Platform, installe les "
"packages suivants :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`qiskit_ibm_catalog` provides the client-side tools to upload and run remote"
" programs, while `qiskit_serverless` provides server-side tools to "
"distribute compute and manage data. These packages require `python` 3.11+. "
"For users and organizations who want to run Qiskit Serverless on custom "
"infrastructure, follow the [Cloud infrastructure "
"setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"`qiskit_ibm_catalog` fournit les outils côté client pour téléverser et "
"exécuter des programmes distants, tandis que `qiskit_serverless` fournit les"
" outils côté serveur pour distribuer le calcul et gérer les données. Ces "
"packages nécessitent `python` 3.11 ou supérieur. Pour les utilisateurs et "
"organisations souhaitant exécuter Qiskit Serverless sur une infrastructure "
"personnalisée, consulte le guide [Cloud infrastructure "
"setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Actuellement, le tableau des charges de travail IBM Quantum ne reflète que les charges de travail Qiskit Runtime. Utilise `job.status()` pour voir le statut actuel de ta charge de travail Qiskit Serverless. Tu trouveras un exemple dans le guide [Exécuter ta première charge de travail Qiskit Serverless à distance](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

